":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、DEFとSPDを中ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 616% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -25% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"},{"text":"1 enemy: SPD -25% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_down","tag":"debuff"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"激動のサマーバカンス"},"detail":{"ja":"部隊全体のATKを特大アップ+ATKを毎ターン極小ダウン(最大25ターン)"},"effects":[{"text":"All allies: ATK +25%","icon":"atk_up","tag":"passive"},{"text":"All allies: ATK -1% every turn (up to 25 turns)","icon":"atk_down","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":2,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00003",40],[1,"ubl00355",50],[2,"blo00007",10],[2,"blo00008",10],[3,"blo00010",10],[3,"blo00011",10],[4,"blo00013",10],[4,"blo00014",10],[5,"blo00007",10],[5,"blo00008",10],[6,"blo00010",10],[6,"blo00011",10],[7,"blo00013",10],[7,"blo00014",10],[8,"blo00007",10],[8,"blo00008",10],[9,"blo00010",5],[9,"blo00011",15],[9,"blo00012",5],[10,"blo00007",5],[10,"blo00008",15],[10,"blo00009",5],[11,"blo00013",5],[11,"blo00014",15],[11,"blo00015",5],[12,"blo00003",80],[12,"ubl00355",100],[13,"blo00007",5],[13,"blo00008",15],[13,"blo00009",5],[14,"blo00010",5],[14,"blo00011",15],[14,"blo00012",5],[15,"blo00013",5],[15,"blo00014",15],[15,"blo00015",5],[16,"blo00007",5],[16,"blo00008",15],[16,"blo00009",5],[17,"blo00010",5],[17,"blo00011",15],[17,"blo00012",5],[18,"blo00013",5],[18,"blo00014",15],[18,"blo00015",5],[19,"blo00007",5],[19,"blo00008",15],[19,"blo00009",5],[20,"blo00011",10],[20,"blo00012",15],[21,"blo00008",10],[21,"blo00009",15],[22,"blo00014",10],[22,"blo00015",15],[23,"blo00011",10],[23,"blo00012",15],[24,"blo00008",10],[24,"blo00009",15],[25,"blo00014",10],[25,"blo00015",15],[26,"blo00003",30],[26,"ubl00355",50],[27,"blo00009",5],[27,"blo00012",5],[27,"blo00015",5],[28,"blo00009",5],[28,"blo00012",5],[28,"blo00015",5],[29,"blo00009",5],[29,"blo00012",5],[29,"blo00015",5],[30,"blo00009",5],[30,"blo00012",5],[30,"blo00015",5],[31,"blo00003",25],[31,"ubl00355",100],[32,"blo00009",5],[32,"blo00012",5],[32,"blo00015",5],[33,"blo00009",5],[33,"blo00012",5],[33,"blo00015",5],[34,"blo00009",5],[34,"blo00012",5],[34,"blo00015",5],[35,"blo00009",5],[35,"blo00012",5],[35,"blo00015",5],[36,"blo00003",50],[36,"ubl00355",50],[37,"blo00009",5],[37,"blo00012",5],[37,"blo00015",5],[38,"blo00009",5],[38,"blo00012",5],[38,"blo00015",5],[39,"blo00009",5],[39,"blo00012",5],[39,"blo00015",5],[40,"blo00009",5],[40,"blo00012",5],[40,"blo00015",5],[41,"blo00003",25],[41,"ubl00355",100],[42,"blo00009",5],[42,"blo00012",5],[42,"blo00015",5],[43,"blo00009",5],[43,"blo00012",5],[43,"blo00015",5],[44,"blo00009",5],[44,"blo00012",5],[44,"blo00015",5],[45,"blo00009",5],[45,"blo00012",5],[45,"blo00015",5],[46,"blo00003",50],[46,"ubl00355",50],[47,"blo00009",5],[47,"blo00012",5],[47,"blo00015",5],[48,"blo00009",5],[48,"blo00012",5],[48,"blo00015",5],[49,"blo00009",5],[49,"blo00012",5],[49,"blo00015",5],[50,"blo00009",5],[50,"blo00012",5],[50,"blo00015",5]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"お館様、お待たせいたしました……すみません、着替えに時間がかかってしまいまして。さ、参りましょうか","en":"\"My Lord, thank you for waiting… Sorry, changing took longer than expected. Shall we proceed?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"海に入る前は、必ず準備運動をしてください――って、毎年言っている気がしますね……もう、なにを笑っているんですか。大事なことですよ？","en":"\"Before you enter the sea, be sure to warm up—I've been saying that every year, haven't I? So, what are you laughing at? It's important!\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"プライベートビーチだといっても、節度は弁えるように。人の目がないだけで、外なんですから……羽目を外しすぎないよう、注意してください","en":"\"Even on a private beach, maintain some decorum. Just because no one's watching doesn't mean it's not public… Don't go overboard.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"お館様、戻られましたか。お食事の支度ができています……はい、お察しの通り、バーベキューです。海といえばこれか、お店のやきそばですね","en":"\"My Lord, have you returned? Dinner is ready… As you guessed, it's a barbecue. When it comes to the sea, nothing beats our shop's yakisoba.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"さて、私もひと泳ぎしてきましょうか――きゃっ！？　す、すみません、紐がほどけてしまって……あの、見えましたか？","en":"\"Well then, I'll go for a quick swim—ah! S-sorry, my strap came undone… Did you see that?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"――また来たいですね、来年も……その次も、その次の年も……はい、もちろん――時子はいつまでも、お館様のお傍におりますので","en":"\"I'd love to come back again, next year… and the year after, and the next… Yes, of course—Tokiko will always be by your side, my Lord.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"あまり冷たいものばかりで、お腹を壊したら大変ですから……はい、湯冷ましの麦茶です","en":"\"Too many cold foods can upset your stomach… Here, a cup of cooled barley tea.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"荷物の積み込みは終わりましたか？　では、名残惜しいですが帰りましょう……また来年、ですね","en":"\"Are you done loading the luggage? Then, as reluctant as I am, let's head back… See you next year.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"お、お館様……こ、この手をどかしたらその、見えてしまいますから……","en":"\"M-My Lord… if you move this hand, you'll… you'll see…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00355_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"お館様にオイルを塗って頂いたからでしょうか、その……身体が火照ってきてしまってます……","en":"\"Is it because you applied oil to me, my Lord? My body is getting all warm…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00355_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"や、こ、これはオイルです！　お、お館様を想って濡れてしまっているなんて、そんな事は……！","en":"\"Th-this is oil! I… I'm not… getting wet because I'm thinking of you, Lord!\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00355_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00355_1/uni00355_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/u